# The callbacks call what records of a table hold under one name. Their loops test for each of these, and look at the receiver before the elements.
# RUN: link functions mechanisms=all
# CHECK: table-callee of 0 MathTanh
# CHECK-NEXT: table-callee of 0 f
# CHECK-NEXT: table-callee of 0 f
# CHECK: table-callee of 0 MathCos
# CHECK-NEXT: table-callee of 0 f
